1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,742
Bio pesticides are living things, or substances from them, used against pests.

2
00:00:05,742 --> 00:00:08,085
Bt against caterpillars.

3
00:00:08,085 --> 00:00:11,861
The fungus Trichoderma against soil borne diseases.

4
00:00:11,861 --> 00:00:14,101
A virus against Helicoverpa.

5
00:00:14,101 --> 00:00:14,921
Neem.

6
00:00:14,921 --> 00:00:19,270
And tiny Trichogramma wasps that parasitise the eggs of borers.

7
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:27,200
They are specific, spare bees and birds, and leave no residue, though they act slowly and do not keep long.

